WEBVTT

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:30.241
Če se bo božanski genij, ki ti je dodeljen

00:18:30.265 --> 00:18:35.325
odločil, da pokaže to čarobnost 
samo za trenutek,

00:18:35.349 --> 00:18:38.029
skozi tvoje prizadevanje, potem "Olé!"

00:18:38.053 --> 00:18:40.964
In če ne, prav tako odpleši svoj ples.

00:18:40.988 --> 00:18:42.645
In "Olé!" kljub temu.

00:18:42.669 --> 00:18:44.955
Verjamem v to in mislim, 
da je to treba učiti.

00:18:44.979 --> 00:18:46.433
"Olé!" kljub vsemu,

00:18:46.457 --> 00:18:49.746
že samo zato, ker zaradi 
same ljubezni in vztrajnosti

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:51.591
nadaljuješ svoje delo.

00:18:51.615 --> 00:18:53.266
Hvala.

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:55.341
(Aplavz)

00:18:55.365 --> 00:18:56.832
Hvala.

00:18:56.856 --> 00:18:59.946
(Aplavz)

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:01.779
June Cohen: Olé!